{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1409,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:571b8dfd7c0b087e14676283",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请看，这件斗篷和肩章！\r\n和我最憧憬的明星…\r\n帝王同学是同款哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "053a9a780bab0a12e5b3edc6316a37ef6a2fe807066c613920230868b25d8174",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1d9bafbfc1f098ae48c0030",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要戴着这枚宝石胸针，\r\n就感觉我能一口气跑到天涯海角。\r\n…因为上面镌刻着，永恒的羁绊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9734cc204399bc04d2aa15cc804437ccde7b0bd7ebaffabbff31bf9b6404a64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "91229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9c0feb243cb6e64c661f1bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我对自己强健的身体很有自信！\r\n所以呢，训练员，你就尽情\r\n严格地锻炼我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ced8d45a86106acbcd513dd04be9d5106fb9af7f6b368e6210c6a3c2e1ca0940",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02dbd7b9de766fc33a35be3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "頑張るぞー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3dbc2842c3016d019ad3d16ba9de8e7ba512d3802e70bf64467d3af5bee806cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5da0d0d14370eb03f9bbe37f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我不像帝王一样厉害……\r\n但只要脚踏实地努力，\r\n一定也能……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ade7d9c7b619d20b849b600749e3393a4dfda8c8f8896fca56d576b0745cd9dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c05af26e97add7a4b5a938d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祭典也是一样，事前准备非常重要！\r\n为了在大日子开花结果，要加油啰～",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ee88645182bf61518234c9d51a205c3ff76cfdc7f521c1971d03a0494622e70",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0358eb7968208295270101b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊啊～！\r\n嗯，发声也很顺利……\r\n我准备好了，训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a41392b8f8529ca69a5d8fba71685a94658bb4adabbca0535ab98f624e1dd56c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:305731df14177d61827c2c77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为我是「助人大将小北」嘛！\r\n训练员，你也可以\r\n尽情依赖我喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d825280d8935e3b7b57c05ec3e4b95c91820e25393254a23aea168565913c6e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31931cf605fb7eb9cd9ef425",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员就是属于我的「助人大将」！\r\n所以我要说……\r\n一直以来谢谢你了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2f2f542b86c1e40519ef02ce07c8bb7f04bcab5f182128290961072133827c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:804b50263efc29f72dd358b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员会因为看到我的笑容而笑……\r\n我觉得这种情谊非常棒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc3d1ba879bb1060a3de5977a6a15995b47d7d6d294b675cba2c52616a8a79ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20a19d3cd7f4243dc0f25fa2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏天到了！集训开始！\r\n真令人热血燃烧呢～\r\n鼓足干劲吧！！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "805a51e0afe3d3f2f9f34d0c5bb91f536b45894fcf9b80d7e1708b471504bb26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72153711a1313246c4177c6f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好～我要全力以赴──！！\r\n……啊，身体太往前倾，\r\n又差点撞到鼻子了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20def3d072a59d0c627bc50e61757dfcf4d7468a36155ef13a3e14666eba586b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:049813612f4c64ccd7bbb5ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做伸展运动时要像鹤一样优雅地\r\n伸展身体……想象是在展开翅膀！\r\n……好！今天也要拜托你了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0299f878c357ae7b53a714aec78cfb4aa370419d542e2b6975896ca4752fed9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e2ac3a64b8c3e548d58bcb8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家都专注地跑在\r\n自己的道路上……！\r\n我也要努力别被她们甩在后面！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e88433587ef916aaf4960a6c357f7a456d2173122c74b6309ec2850f1b5c6b48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b90445e58c0d81490e3ed62c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "靠赛马娘巫女参拜锻炼出来的精神，\r\n感觉在训练时也能派上用场呢！\r\n不管什么训练都尽管来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "17929f1fe0fae5dd4dffc00f906dca835daef09ac28a737476fbd850959f0a3b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb2f6766aef1ab0ffcde8ba2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论何时都不能忘记初衷！\r\n我到现在都还记得，第一次跟\r\n训练员见面时感受到的悸动呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "195ad08df2590f475f0ceb9e374d41f57b90a2396554d13497d35e3a9d53ced2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38ef91696ee383d2686517b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想进一步振翅高飞！\r\n和训练员一起……\r\n飞向未来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "643ec2446eedab90cc0826c0f6d15b5d62a80a44e9ccb2166ebf3315dcc9bbc0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc781063dfcf999f30a6cecb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我相信无论时光如何流逝，\r\n训练员都会陪在我身边！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a8958455c71a8a91d6f990ec13801d2febc6bb0832415be9bfab767c580945a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:594a364937f0321dbfa222f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我觉得皇冠是荣耀的象征。\r\n我想成为能让大家绽放笑容…那样\r\n闪闪发光的赛马娘！",
      "source_fingerprint": "72c4d1ce900703c0be9879746efd1e1017577bed347346641bbec0bdf850d810",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "92215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edfb3992800474ac8e886481",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "拖轮胎、劈瓦片、攀悬崖…\r\n不管什么训练项目\r\n都可以！放马过来吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce124118af9ae6909bac3c64756decb036c5683e34d2aa362db0277afbcc2433",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "92216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df6333caa6b1d31d6e977917",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管面对何种逆境，我都将\r\n勇往直前！…嗯，是不是应该\r\n说得再威风一点比较好呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9810410e4cde9fa3bb0649cd172c4c18dcb8c22f43302c13316576aaf16ab39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "92217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3821fbdabc805c5752d60fba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "短裤活动起来很方便呢！\r\n当初憧憬着帝王同学开始\r\n奔跑的时候…穿的就是这种裤子来着",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c6fe52868ed0b7c9bbb2286ec8a8acb2d9892fcf6067454afdfe3dc477086c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "92218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54d87128d17997bfb8b6a3ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了成为与彩纸屑\r\n相衬的赛马娘！\r\n目标就是、成为大明星！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2f29a5a50d0e5f6ee233ec9fcf69481d37c8fe7d9571f6be77c035fbee43f47",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "92220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81ab1cd4195bebd9de4bd401",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "沿着指南针指引的方向，\r\n向着荣耀…！\r\n让我们一起出发吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0639554e5b2a6d7baf0c54bfe3885c1be27475966298576c996fcb48d8c8ae3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "92221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37fa61bf58d67dc6cf4b2ce4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即便是成为大明星，\r\n如果是和训练员的话…嗯。\r\n我想和您一起实现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78f36b536ef43f6e900d071cd3215a24634d6526b4dc7eef018255058ca74ca4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "92222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f18fd13e4250f92008ff87ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能如此盛装……都是多亏有训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d302ef8c73f594dae39f491835f6041df6ed96cc893c4d406c7a7e24747a62ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed2f1971a78e28b2b85a8a58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我唱首歌回报这份恩情吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "41901b9b2b42c227862bc930ca75911218a4ac97420f7248126f3c96030677cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7177dd528fa8e3cae091b2e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们一起取得的成果…\r\n如同日出般耀眼呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e64272432df5593e4916dc7429339bf0d0a723119de34a50a66be48fec5f1af8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01553c8803c8dc2aa46e15d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是可喜可贺的结果～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78b011917f633e17600c1c3e274a69579e5d2bbe26128f3caf2b8bc6774d5c8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b36f67d3e8a666f89efc0441",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "特别的景象…能和训练员\r\n一起看到！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f2d310ed5aae45c278e550ff495b0c62bdadc3ae79f2bc0658b1ceffff3d2bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "93204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81fcb7b0abfc8d2a79f0633f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欢呼声和掌声我全都收下啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "39a1ae709d9d3a6c283d994ffa56a282eee39d3df54538a3aee14a6e06dfd773",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "93205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:394409d40c2ac19a92f73812",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胸中感到「咚咚！」地一阵高昂！",
      "source_fingerprint": "00bbaf1973abe782f4068d98cea7a1097cbfb14ea19f2737776dd467fbeac975",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:faabe5b563f4630a07c12155",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇咻～！祭典要开始了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "39672d602688cf9f5855bffd896155b4e917d7de428bd5291fd2f86da62ca312",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bae512baf2e3620645f1518",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是北部玄驹！请多多指教！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9e0e53fba1f05e0c70d4bc05f2c02cb7edb8e8df80ea1847ee7d7cefc62254b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff592941f8b4607a6c7aff1b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "人称祭典女孩！\r\n只要我获胜周围就会笑容满开！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cea9dd4cf5c1da70a2d1430d5f59301cd5f6d41e28f3f2a1b29ff9b3839dfee2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60e1dad1715886d638f18bf6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我什么都愿意帮忙！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c682c6a204d8748e8f5f061268e0d687ebaee639043e4c888ec879f011e42ece",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3344a08102fe3643163a11cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "尽量吩咐工作来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7631deec061a5e74e7088c712813f13ec42eda3d023a8fdad31f13d35195ac76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d200575cc3964710100311be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目标是抵达巅峰！没错吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "93fb9658f04a7b09c7748f9ef5bda997cf64c7f6b3099f6ef59db7f113285186",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f68019f722221a966d95a142",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉能再飞得更高！",
      "source_fingerprint": "424791150e89b593557c2b30c61061aa5ca73d921cf17c1e2b9cc5b0e84fa0e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb6c4b9592e6a22f7fd63a8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "持续了千年的愿望……\r\n就由我来照亮！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbd3c7dc810d800809f7f857e1d8ce7d5df1a5e01b50f55b96c958c8fac612d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac89f7cd4fbdcfe8623b9b53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是北部玄驹！\r\n一起飞向未来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "65115ead5c37d2ee2166d061504ace8c914a1d288862fa48841051bb90d3f071",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10a072d969eb6681006e2a6f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "憧れに近づけました！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64b3e9c96151d7b4cb984502b3c029431fb74d151ddb537d3f2938b9fe5ce2ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "95207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c0714df90d5bf4ac80cb5c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今よりもきらきらの舞台に…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8860cc80ae259942cf90904481ac4c2ab09f467e80a29b72d5ce336293d2ce4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "95208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ec7b14a7a4f9f4d017c8894",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あたしだけの花道――\r\nここに駆け抜けますっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a5a44b5b8ca28362fcab36f1524ec14cb96cd40b9b51f2894bac4550ae67f37",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "95209"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ca227ac328eb41bb020c1ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "キタサンブラック…\r\n夢に向かって！",
      "source_fingerprint": "471a4de984ed1d31f055cb383d8bddf30669b896caa37355d5474f38a4987e73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1068",
        "95210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:344e64d51c575ebdf5167f43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3eb5b5f74ef2384c6c0a89d001ced307776a3b463e8ad6c297c9c98980420a95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83ad148c8ffb20de34f6eff8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对丸善斯基小姐的感情？憧憬、尊敬、\n爱慕――根本说不完啦！\n她就是这样优秀到我没法描述的人嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "686828cbee65f35e2e8f183d47f5599adc188324cbc80f7e229bece995ba9852",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52b792573a66502c94fd8807",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出门了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "495f36ee69ba563cc7c4921486cbc711ed9b1bd1d2b59f0cdf2bd7af020cbb78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c74d4dc52ec6c43995a8c3a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了ー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "661195b495376f2ba1f17ce1fbadaab1f08f9e1a9ba90fdba5b32a1dcbfedac7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7160eaf9f340db6e6e14ed0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要和训练员一起的话……\n只要我们两个人一起的话，我觉得\n不管多么远大的梦想都能实现呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d879fa2bb01d9ef8f0060d425425b01ec19f213f891a29f7d14ba4249b54a6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2a0cdf19c36c990cf1f6321",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对了，下次我把樱花汪王也带过来吧！\n它也一定很想和训练员见面的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8177664a6f22175f5c5379a08f66e9a0ee228080843cdc44c3bf6ae138126cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8cfa9229fbbf5aadade8c1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐，训练员！\n昨天我梦见了吉兆哦，俗话说『一草地二坡道三沙土』嘛！\n（注：日本新年做梦三吉兆，一富士二鹰三茄子）",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6b490db27ff311c043c913df902485aec1d0f856253b0d719d31fd1eeabc632",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ed9e9c0b226182b45dc69ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『巧克力的温度等同于赛马娘的斗志』\r\n――也就是说需要\r\n适度的热量吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3a5e5ae08dd38aa82c776844abf48278eb8141e90ba07c58e7d9b5b020c8502",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:829a89cda5e10b1bb08233c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一做点心就容易做成和风的呢……\n对了，我做了和三盆松露哦！\n要是能合您口味就好啦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac4b673231538283e4d10f3a0e29be3a4029c101194f01a5da56c2fac2180d49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c5c4524a90ac5629ca1235c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我哥哥曾经在七夕节的时候赢过比赛哦。\n自那以后，七夕也变成我们家值得庆祝的节日了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "11f2bf8d183c3f79ffb6395694eaee891f973fe9c9befa23f2aa887b4c04bba9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2df5b40abd8010e24575b90b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家变装的水准都好高……！\n我……\n我就只是把被单反过来披在身上假扮幽灵而已……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c597f57db1e13b8c9f96495330d919d014638e9e152afb2f8ff374b8457e78aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c63122b4327839a8e04e547",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在圣诞节的时候，我和家人们就会一边说着什么『圣诞限定，大金星』，一边在家里的树上挂上装饰品呢。呵呵♪\n（注：大金星是相扑术语，意为低段位选手战胜最高段位的选手）",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e00801c6a3087e45e268b43c25fe97d3f5becf99c95d6664ae07b5fde31ce34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bb0cee3eb71978ea617c526",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，一起来吃蛋糕吧！\n俗话说，\n『吃过同一炉蛋糕的才算朋友』嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "556213da8fb15722f31c675d78e5575ea02e2d2098a79bbf5c125156cd4102e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb5cc9a1f47ee6d2c29db6d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是努力的成果呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1da31127bda85a15e39451f2adb47c012077bf09d262cf97bc4ca7ab67df29f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7751d93cf9a00a90c7cfe9a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从去年到今年，然后再到明年——\n虽然我还是那个普通的赛马娘，\n但我也觉得我成长了不少哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f7d5ec2f097251b5cc1e3500de47fce02ee4f63aa84bfc9b030d2fe9ba57222",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09e4417f25124ea1256c3854",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，生日快乐哦！\n今天就由我来给予训练员勇气吧！\n千代～OH！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a226a528010115de55c74f8eee7eeb53d18e00fcc941dd509add6da410f9010",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25305ab9875433dde94275d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要我为您捶下肩膀吗？\n还是我来帮您做饭呢？\n今天请一定要让我帮上忙哦，训练员♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "116e90e7e99024d398a6ffc45a6eab764364ca2e04732c0a66acce8782105f80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dc434a1321598345b2a9c65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天是我的生日呢！\n为了能成为樱花满开的大树，\n以后也要打起精神继续努力呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b39381c1723eb9fe35c96911c97cef04788522e97194bb91db32e9cbba0a306c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70187ffcd4e4f285c54524dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您、您是在祝我生日快乐吗…！？\n非常感谢！\n作为回礼，请让我思考几句训练员专用的格言吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba5cef3233adefc6ffd84543887c6445e922c27c657b81d4d27a5c45ea107390",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56def392cfb761555a838c05",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "似乎有新的通知呢！\n真让人激动不已！",
      "source_fingerprint": "809f1a8c6f5b9d343eada5e0aa4125b8f5de3cf82cfed0d7ded54fbe93233ace",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bfd03f74a682ddf6e154a6f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有礼物送到了呢！\n会是什么呢……\n快点打开看看吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "168543914708599062850bff2cfa391f45447113147fcecd1913727c594832e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:152347f49e56f9f7671425b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务完成了哦！\n果然训练员非常靠得住呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2dfcfdde3d236eaf5038e33095ec35ad8ca2e9723783fca68fc63210f4c048e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fb93838172c1d9a56e1e44b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动就快开始了呢！\n好，一起好好努力，\n为活动做准备吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c167fcc475e260589268daa5e65e6e25b49274e87bd34e860aba7f73f8d36e42",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc3082d19f45470567fcad02",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动已经开始了哦！\n……蹄铁没问题，耳饰也戴好了！\n好，准备ok了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "603e99317ce103a1da95290d485755b9fb5ce486a3e3e3437b3ce548ea4fc032",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:233ccafbede5e99415569d9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是不更加努力的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "599ba88d36f0e59c2ce490d397f513d768f069815e713f36d86c69e37d5deffa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eab719a1ea6d1cf80c698906",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鉴等级提升了哦！\n我也要以不输给训练员的气势加油了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8438b662190f5b46145569873aac4e4178c88d6294b7ac1aa064df7ea6b560b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6f46e1191e03330136f1a53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "马甲…背心…\r\n背心…马甲…。\r\n这叫法是…马甲Best？",
      "source_fingerprint": "57bb8cda687f4a4d0180b76e7c35ab425c9663bd6a607d28a51ac6b6deb5cf6a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afae2596acf04ee3b9dd913f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胸前闪耀的，是樱花徽章！\r\n出身于『胜利俱乐部』的话，\r\n就不自觉地会选这种呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "13676085c2c265d9aed84a5025578fa72bd5bbb2f1aca9dac4dee35dec08b7f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:929229c0c1de31cd7bea2453",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很喜欢这种\r\n粗编织的毛衣。因为可以\r\n很轻松地套在身上！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bb09fc54f59f0c0fe5b6803fc0ced9b38206c9bbd97988b08432b4fbc203a93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2687a7c3e291c160b4692820",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "平局吗…",
      "source_fingerprint": "902444f0ed7e1616722b72af6a279cd6f7805a624cf081b4f2933cdda03615ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8dd7d78a071dadf878dc4f8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是白星呢！\n（注：白星为相扑术语，意为胜出）",
      "source_fingerprint": "936dc232044873e33a48394178d3121a3ba0b4ef37c321ea5d7494d4208c0a4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d0117e944a674fae0d324cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是不更加努力的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "599ba88d36f0e59c2ce490d397f513d768f069815e713f36d86c69e37d5deffa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efe0a2350fcb053752a38387",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "平局吗…",
      "source_fingerprint": "902444f0ed7e1616722b72af6a279cd6f7805a624cf081b4f2933cdda03615ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9dcd6223d9e453a208dda3e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "等级提升了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ed1325d905bfec4203de1e111bbc72dd1f8fc65c2ce9cad8d167c3ec733a91e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aeb9a94e37df3bb47e86c00a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以大金星为目标！\n（注：大金星是相扑术语，意为低段位选手战胜最高段位的选手）",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a62367d97276f3f41cdcd3dda76212223c31b2539f566c6ee2aec193cea6c12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "1008"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
